{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s57-p01",
      "text": "Here is the car of the future!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p02",
      "text": "This car is very different from today's cars: It is quiet and clean.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p03",
      "text": "Unlike the average car today, which has wheels, this one does not.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p04",
      "text": "It moves like a snail, but is much faster than a snail!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p05",
      "text": "This car will use electricity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p06",
      "text": "It will use digital technology such as cameras to navigate.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p07",
      "text": "It will drive itself, like a robot.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p08",
      "text": "You just need to tell it your destination, and the car will go there.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p09-01",
      "text": "Therefore, people who are often busy with work, such as presidents or lawyers,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p09-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p09-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p09-02",
      "text": "are free to make phone calls on the way.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p09-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p09-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p10",
      "text": "And there will be self-driving 'taxis' available all day and night.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p11",
      "text": "Also, due to its rapid movement, it will reach the location very quickly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p12",
      "text": "It will also be very safe and comfortable — a smooth ride that feels like magic.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p13-01",
      "text": "Passengers can relax during the journey, perhaps reading a magazine, watching a movie,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p13-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p13-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p13-02",
      "text": "or playing games like an online version of ping-pong.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p13-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p13-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p14-01",
      "text": "The car can also reduce the risk of accidents,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p14-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p14-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p14-02",
      "text": "providing safe transport for firemen and police officers on their way to work.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p14-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p14-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p15",
      "text": "A lot of the technology has already appeared, but it is at the experimental stage.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p16",
      "text": "As an exciting development, fifty years from now, some new roads will have solar panels for cars to use.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p17",
      "text": "However, you won't be able to drive a 'snail car', even if you're under 20 today.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p18",
      "text": "Maybe this is the car of the year 2100, and your grandchildren may drive it.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p19",
      "text": "No pollution, no traffic jams, and no stress.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s57-p20",
      "text": "It will be interesting to see what the cars look like many years from now.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s57-p20.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
